window.products.push({"id":548002,"name":"LUOFU 10x12 Picture Frames Set of 2,White Picture Frame 10x12,Display Pictures 7x9 with Mat or 10x12 without Mat,Multi Photo Frames Collage for Wall A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sDzSAV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-quality and High-definition plexiglass】These frames are made of PS board and plexiglass,strong and durable,wear-resistant and easy to clean.And prevent dust and scratches from damaging the photos.We use high-definition plexiglass instead of ordinary fragile glass to be safer,don't worry about the glass slag will hurt the child when it falls.💎Warm Tips:In order to maintain the high definition of plexiglass,be sure to tear off the protective film on both sides of the plexiglass before use. 【Multi-size and multi-function】These 10x12 white picture frames external size of a single photo frame: 10.8x12.8x0.6 inches---Display picture size: 10x12 inch picture without mat or 7x9 inch picture with mat (mat opening size: 6.5x8.5 inches).With a movable hook on the back of the photo frame,which can be hung on the wall or placed on the table for horizontally or vertically.You can purchase products of different sizes according to your needs and DIY-freely combine photo walls anywhere. 【Easy to use and Easy to install】Simple and convenient to use,the spring action removes the back plate,place the photo,cover the back plate and buckle the spring.The back of the photo frame has a movable hanging hook and seamless wall nail accessories.Fix the wall nails on the wall and hang the hook on the wall nail.💎Warm Tips:For details,please refer to the product manual. 【Simple and Modern style】These Understated black or white picture frames perfect for any pieces of photos and prints. adopts a classic and simple design,suitable for Dress up living room,bedroom,kids room,gallery wall,office decor and any space. can record beautiful moments in life and add warmth to the home.It also Great gift for Christmas, Thanksgiving,best friend birthday to display your travel souvenirs,certificates,artwork,landscape pictures,family photos and other precious pictures 【Protective Packaging and Services】For this product,we use 5 layers of protective packaging (4 corners-plastic film-foam bag-cardboard box-Amazon packaging),so you don't worry about receiving damaged products,we guarantee photo frames will be delivered intact and safe In your hands.If you have any questions,please contact our seller by email as soon as possible,and we will be happy to provide you with the best help. 【Special attention】💎The size of the opening of the mat is slightly smaller than the size of the displayed picture, so that the overall displayed picture will be more beautiful, and the picture displayed with the mat will not leave blank margins. For detailed dimensions, please refer to the detailed description of the product","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sDzSAV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUOFU","source_asin":"B09HNSPK7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HNSPK7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HNSPK7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
