window.products.push({"id":548348,"name":"Wallniture Vesti Wall Shelf with 8 Hooks for Hanging Coats, Wood Coat Rack & Mail Organizer for Entryway Farmhouse Decor, Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dQXbu+EdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish Storage Solution: Open your front door into a beautifully organized wall decor. Instead of using a big entryway table, hang Vesti storage shelf with hooks on your empty wall and keep clutter in a more nifty way! Multi-Functional: Our Vesti design can act as a hat rack, key organizer, coat hanger, mail holder for wall at the same time! You can hang your coat, bag, car key, and more on the hooks while sorting in-going or out-going mail on small shelf organizer, and keep everything you need within reach at your fingertips. Nifty Wall Hooks: Wallniture Vesti entryway organization and storage shelf comes with 4 front hooks, and 2 double hooks on both ends, making it a total of 8 durable hooks for hanging coats, keys, bags, hats, dog leashes, and more Functionally-Wise: Get creative and find more functions other than entryway organizer. Vesti wall hanging shelf with hooks can act as a kitchen pantry organization and storage unit! You can store your cookbooks while using the hooks as a kitchen utensil holder. Comes Ready to Use: Our mail, coat and key holder for wall come fully assembled with all necessary mounting hardware. Just follow easy instructions to install Vesti floating shelf on your empty wall space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dQXbu+EdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wallniture","source_asin":"B077YY6CW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077YY6CW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077YY6CW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548349,"name":"2.6 Gallon Cold Beverage Dispenser - Spigot and Lid – Elegant Glass Party Buffet Centerpiece for Iced Tea, Lemonade, Fruit Punch, Cocktails and All Dr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-ABWPShRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Serving your signature drink is easier than you think! With the Glass Cold Drink Dispenser from Lux ’n Lavish you can allow your guests to help themselves to a refreshingly cool beverage. Serve delicious sangria, lemonade, punches, infused water and more! Show off your hosting skills when you showcase this self-serving drink dispenser. It makes all of your indoor and outdoor parties or events more delightful. High-quality glass won’t leak and it keeps beverages protected and cool with an easy to open lid and a wide mouth opening that makes it easy to fill and clean. BENEFITS & FEATURES: Premium Quality Glass For all Iced and Cold Beverages Hand Wash in Cold Water 2.6 Gallon Capacity Easy Pour, Leak Proof Spigot Knobbed Glass Lid ELEGANT AND DECORATIVE A simple yet sophisticated design provides the perfect display for delicious drinks. It makes an elegant centerpiece for your bar, buffet, countertop or dinner table. Serve anything from cocktails, wine, juice, infused water, ice tea, and more! It fits in with any home décor or party theme and a crystal clear glass allows you to flaunt elegant garnishments like fruit or mint leaves. VERSATILE AND DURABLE This multi-use jug is great for entertainment and everyday use. It’s great for indoor or outdoor entertaining and it fits almost anywhere. Keep it chilled in the refrigerator or perch it on your counter top. The easy to use spigot allows your guests to easily pour liquids into a glass or cup. GREAT FOR PARTIES There won’t be a dry mouth in sight! This self-serving beverage dispenser is ideal for all of your parties and events. Now your guests can help themselves to a refreshing drink while you mingle and enjoy the fun. Set yours up anywhere you like and make the perfect quench station for all of your friends and family. Party smart with Lux ’n Lavish !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-ABWPShRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lux 'n Lavish","source_asin":"B07DM5N5B2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DM5N5B2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DM5N5B2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
