window.products.push({"id":548362,"name":"SILVER ONE Cozy Wearable Fleece Throw Blanket with Pocket, Comfy Robe for Men or Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYgxARQoL._AC_SL1131_.jpg","description":"PLUSH LOUNGEWEAR: What’s better than a blanket you can wear around? Slip it on over the front of your body, sprawl out on the couch, and enjoy the full-body coverage of this warm wearable blanket in your downtime. Stay toasty all day long in its ultra-soft velvet and experience the ultimate softness and lightweight comfort. Perfect for snuggles with your pets, kids, or significant other. A GREAT GIFT FOR ANYONE: When Christmas/Mother's Day and other holidays roll around, consider these oversize unisex blankets as a gift for a friend or loved one. Any man or woman, especially sleepwear enthusiasts, will love its thick, snuggly embrace at the end of a long day. Unlike many gift alternatives, you will be able to use this wearable blanket daily all year long. BUILT-IN FRONT POCKET: It’s all too easy to lose remote controls, cell phones, food, and more in your blanket while you’re relaxing in bed or on the couch. Just like your favorite pants, these blankets feature large sewn-on pockets that can accommodate a number of loose items and keep them in one place where you can easily find them. INNOVATIVE SLEEVE DESIGN: It’s the issue as old as time that you’ve faced at one point or another; you’re trying to keep your upper body all wrapped up in your blanket but you still need your arms free to control the remote or type on your laptop. This blanket is designed with sleeves to give you the freedom you need to use your hands while reading or eating a snack while watching TV. PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: Unlike your average bathrobe, this giant fuzzy blanket robe measures 60” x 78”, making it perfect for anybody from young children to adults. It’s made from 250 GSM of luxury microfiber polyester, an easy-to-care-for material. Instead of putting on a sweatshirt on a cold day, curl up with this comfortable throw blanket and get warm from head to toe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYgxARQoL._AC_SL1131_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SILVER ONE","source_asin":"B07CZQ6S6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZQ6S6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CZQ6S6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
