window.products.push({"id":548371,"name":"IRIS TACHI Modular Wood Stacking Storage Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iiMjKYTVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep clutter contained and everyday necessities nearby with our versatile storage boxes. From desktop to living room, to closets and beyond, they help organize and stow items anywhere in your home. Retractable garage-style door provides easy access inside and closes smoothly to hide items away for a clean look. Stackable design maximizes floor space and can even double as a clever side table. With six available styles in two complementary wood-grain colors, you can mix and match to create customizable storage that suits all your unique needs. Some Assembly Required. Inner Dimensions: 11.5\"L x 14.75\"W x 11\"H. Weight Capacity: 22 pounds each top and bottom board, total 44 pounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iiMjKYTVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IRIS USA, Inc.","source_asin":"B01LVU4A3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LVU4A3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LVU4A3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548372,"name":"Fab Glass and Mirror 24\" Inch Square Clear 1/2 Thick Tempered Flat Polished Radius Corners Glass Table Top,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+968rPNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐨𝐟 𝐓𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐨𝐩 - A glass table top is a piece of furniture with a flat surface made out of glass. Glass tabletops are popular for their aesthetic appeal and ability to blend with any decor. These clear tempered glass tabletops are more durable than normal glass and are heat-resistant and less likely to break or shatter. ✔ 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐓𝐨𝐩 𝐓𝐡𝐢𝐜𝐤𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬 - The glass table top also adds a unique, modern touch to any room. Many glass tabletops are available in a variety of shapes and styles.It's a sturdy 24” Square glass tabletop with a thickness of 1/2\" inch (13mm) Flat Polished edges that adds elegance to both the interior and exterior of a table. ★ 𝐔𝐬𝐞𝐬 𝐨𝐟 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐨𝐩 - If you're looking for a stylish and modern way to add character to your home, rectangular table top glass has different sizes which can perfectly fit on your glass table top. It can be used as coffee tables, end tables, dining tables - even as wall art! so they make great choices for homes with children or pets. ✔ 𝐅𝐮𝐧𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲 𝐨𝐟 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐬 𝐓𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐨𝐩 - Glass table top is a great choice for any room. They are aesthetically pleasing and can be used to create a modern look. Glass table tops are also great for small spaces since they don’t take up much visual space. They can be used as coffee tables, end tables, dining tables, and more. ★ 𝐀𝐟𝐭𝐞𝐫-𝐒𝐚𝐥𝐞𝐬 𝐀𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 - After-sales support is fast and reliable – with our easy return process. Our delivery damage rate is extremely low, at less than 0.5%. If something arrives damaged, we offer fast replacements or refunds free of charge. We strive to respond as quickly as possible to all inquiries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+968rPNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fab Glass and Mirror","source_asin":"B00G97I33O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G97I33O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G97I33O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548373,"name":"Descaling Cleaning Solution for all Coffee and Espresso Machines - ORMRI Certified for Organic Use (4 Single Use Packets)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517NwQ6sS5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A safe and effective powder descaler for removing hard water scale from espresso machine boilers, coffee and milk delivery lines. Can also be used to descale bottles and kettles. Contains a synergistic blend of organic acids that give outstanding scale removal. Our coffee machine cleaner is registered by Biological Farmers of Australia (BFA) as an allowed input in organic systems and is certified by the Organic Materials Review Institute (OMRI). This product is free from phosphate and Genetically Modified Organisms. The ingredients and formulation of the products that are NSF certified are safe, leave no harmful residues and do not cause corrosion within the coffee machine. Safe to use on aluminium, brass and stainless steel. All ingredients are all rapidly biodegradable meeting international standards. Each 25g sachet makes up one litre of descaling solution. Directions for use: 1) Add contents of sachet to 1 litre of warm water, dissolve fully and pour into water tank. 2) Remove the filter holder and turn on the machine. 3) Place a cup under the brew spout and run through about 1 cup of the descaling solution. Run about 1/4 cup out through the steam arm. For superautomatic machines, run all the solution through the steam wand and set on hot water (not the steam) setting. 4) Allow to stand for 15 minutes, and then repeat the process. Continue to repeat process until all the solution is used up. 5) To rinse the system thoroughly, run one entire tank of fresh water through the system exiting via the brew head and the steam wand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517NwQ6sS5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artizan Coffee Roasters","source_asin":"B0993W2KR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0993W2KR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0993W2KR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
