window.products.push({"id":548441,"name":"DOWAN Kitchen Utensil Holder, Ceramic Utensils Crock with Table-Protection Cork Mat, Cooking Utensil Holder for Kitchen Décor, Easy to Clean, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G8Uhv2UrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Well Organizer. Dowan utensil holder is 5.7 inches height and 5.2 inches width, which is large enough to hold all the often used utensils on the counter. This black utensil holder can give home chefs a break from digging through messy drawers. Anti-Slip & Anti-Scratch Cork Mat. The cork mat at the bottom of the utensil holder is designed to avoid sliding, and to protect your table or counter top from scratches. If it's spotted, just use a wet rag to wipe it. It's very easy to clean. Versatile Uses. This ceramic utensil holder can serve as many ways, not just for storing kitchen utensils, but also for holding paint brushes, flowers, plants, and even can be used to cool wine. Get In The Holiday Spirit!: If you're looking for a memorable stocking stuffer to gift someone this holiday season, look no further. This classic and unique cooking utensil holder is best for those seeking a trendy, elegant look and makes for a great Christmas gift they'll actually use. Smooth Ceramic Material. Other metal utensil holders can rust and stain your counters with ugly spots over time. Our utensil crock is made of high quality ceramic with smooth finish that it can stand years. It's completely rust and deform proof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G8Uhv2UrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWAN","source_asin":"B09G9YZHVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G9YZHVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G9YZHVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
