window.products.push({"id":548443,"name":"Jupiter Amber Stone Crystal Aura Cube, 2\" Sides (0.7lbs), Carved from Real North American Onyx Aragonite - The Artisan Mined Series by hBAR","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z2PbqddaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cube was mined, carved, and finished by hand to ensure the highest level of quality. Made from amber onyx aragonite, each cube has its own unique coat of bands, eyes, voids, and veins, but all look stunning. The amber color, with shocks of rust, cream, and grey, while being almost a perfect cube, gives you a feeling of calmness and serenity. The smooth stone offers an elegant, refined feeling, making it a versatile addition in any setting. Each cube weighs a little under a pound, and measures 2\" long by 2\" wide and 2\" tall.Every item from the \"Artisan Mined\" series is backed by a complete satisfaction guarantee. As is the nature of true, authentic geological specimens, each specimen is completely unique and some can be more striking or appealing to certain people. If you receive and item and are dissatisfied with the item, we will exchange your item free of charge (in some cases allowing you to preview the set before shipment). We hope you understand the variable nature of such products and want nothing more than for you to be completely satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z2PbqddaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hBARSCI","source_asin":"B06XHD5ZFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XHD5ZFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XHD5ZFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548444,"name":"LIFEREVO Luxury Fluffy Faux Fur Duvet Cover Set, Soft Tie Dye Plush Fuzzy Duvet Cover(1 Marble Print Shaggy Comforter Cover+2 Furry Pillowcases)Beddin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M4fTQt+HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLUFFY DUVET COVER: The tie dye print faux fur duvet cover is designed with a luxurious and fluffy 45mm microfiber faux fur on its front, creating a plush and cozy space. The reverse side is lined with a solid velvet that is soft, fine, and smooth. This fuzzy duvet cover is perfect for cuddling under during chilly days and nights. The hidden zipper design makes it easy to separate and launder, and there are four corner ties inside to better keep the duvet insert in place. FAUX FUR PILLOWCASES: These adorable pillowcases match perfectly with our shaggy comforter covers and come in a variety of colors that will match any room decor. The furry faux fur pillow shams are made with the same fabric as the duvet covers, which has passed OEKO-TEX certification, indicates that they are skin and pet-friendly, and are resistant to fading, shedding, and pilling. The durable concealed zipper closure makes it convenient to wash and maintain. SIZES: The tie dye beige shaggy comforter cover and fuzzy pillow sham sizes are as follows: Twin/Twin XL: 1x duvet cover 68\"x90\", 1x pillow sham 20\"x26\". Full/Queen: 1x duvet cover 90\"x90\", 2x pillow shams 20\"x26\". King: 1x duvet cover 104\"x90\", 2x pillow shams 20\"x36\". These plush bedding sets are suitable for all seasons and make a perfect gift for occasions such as birthdays, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine's Day, Christmas, New Year's Day, housewarming, and more. UNIQUE TIE-DYE DESIGN: Indulge in the exquisite design of our tie dye shaggy comforter cover set. This stunning design is a result of intricate craftsmanship, with the soft fur seamlessly transitioning between colors to create a stylish and chic feel. It can also be used as a bed blanket or decorative bedspread. To complement your unique bed style, we offer matching furry pillowcases, bed skirts, cute throw pillows, and body pillow covers. CARE & SERVICE: To care for this fuzzy comforter cover set, turn it inside-out first and machine wash it on a gentle cycle using cold water. Tumble dry on low and avoid using heat. Do not bleach or iron it. At LIFEREVO, we value your satisfaction and appreciate your love for our products. That's why we offer lifetime customer service. If you have any questions or concerns for this furry bed set, please don't hesitate to contact us for a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91M4fTQt+HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFEREVO","source_asin":"B0B2ZDQH94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2ZDQH94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2ZDQH94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
