window.products.push({"id":548484,"name":"SKYSP Flexible Chimney Sweep Kits 33Foot Long Lifespan Chimney Brush Electrical Drill Drive(10 rods)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617fgVtf+KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package includes: 10x1m Flexible Rods with connectors 1 X Heavy Duty Nylon Bristle Brush Head (40cm)  1 X Drill adapter  1 X Hex tool Application: Suitable for both metal flues and brick chimneys Suitable for pipes of different diameter and shape Suitable for pipes of different length with the help of connecting rods Suitable for curved pipping Advantage: 1.Brush head High density & reinforced nylon rubber composite materials.  Apply the most advanced injection technology.  Hard wearing, and resist to high impact.  Thus the brush head is extremely long lifespan. 2. Bristle Use helical nylon string, making it more durable.  Have a special sharp edged rectangular shape, making the sweep more efficiency.  Also it won‘t scratch the inner surface of the chimney flue With the help of large rotational force, the bristles can remove even the most stubborn build up inside the flue or chimney. 3. Rod The rods are made from nylon, durable, elastic and chemically resistant.  It has a great degree of flexibility, perfectly gets through those tough flue bends.  It's single-pin thread push fitting, no loose during any direction of rotation(clockwise or anticlockwise). How to use: Step 1:Connect the rods one by one Step 2:Attach the bristle with rods Step 3:Put the brush into the flue.  Step 4:Slide the rod into the flue.  Step 5:Attached the drill with rod Step 6:Start cleaning chimney","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617fgVtf+KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKYSP","source_asin":"B07Q5RNJ3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q5RNJ3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q5RNJ3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548485,"name":"Honey-Can-Do HNGZ01530 Wooden Suit Hanger (8 Pack), Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QC8Y3JB4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Honey-Can-Do HNGZ01530 8-Pack Wooden Suit Hanger, Bamboo. A nice version of a classic design, these high-quality hangers are crafted from sustainable bamboo with a smooth, natural finish for a smart way to hang clothes and keep them looking good. The design is slender and contoured to help maintain the natural shape of a suit jacket, and the horizontal bar is great for slacks. Non-slip surface and dual grooves in the hanger's upper edge are perfect for fine blouses and spaghetti strap dresses. The hanger's hook is large and sturdy with an attractive chrome finish and a swivel design for easy use. Packaged here in a set of eight, the piece is also available in ebony and carries a limited lifetime warranty from Honey-Can-Do. A gorgeous upgrade for any closet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QC8Y3JB4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B003E37SA0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003E37SA0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003E37SA0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
