window.products.push({"id":548738,"name":"5 Core Stick Blender 400W, 9 Speed, 3-in-1, Heaviest Duty Copper Motor Immersion Blender, Stainless Steel Blades Hand Blender, Comfy grip Handle, Whis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MlG9Cp3DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Unmatched performance: This immersion blender is the best on the market, with a 4-blade rotation system made from Titanium steel and a powerful 400-watt motor made from full copper. It crushes, pulverizes, and blends smoothly, making any recipe or smoothie effortless to create, and cleaning up the hand mixer afterward is a breeze. ✅ Elegant and practical: The ergonomic grip of the blender provides a comfortable, non-slip grip, even when you continuously blend ingredients for a long time. Its full heavy-duty copper motor is built to withstand long-term use and lasts 3 times longer than competitors' motors. ✅ High performance and efficiency: With 9 speeds, you have maximum control and precision when preparing salsas, shakes, smoothies, baby food, and more! The 400W power drives consistently smooth results and high performance. ✅ A Smart Appliance: Save time, resources, and effort with a multi-functional hand blender. The bell-shaped blending base reduces suction and splashing, allowing you to blend and puree in less time and whisk and chop in seconds. With convenient hook storage and easy-to-detach, dishwasher-safe attachments, this handheld immersion blender is the smart choice for your kitchen. ✅ Versatile & Efficient: The removable blending arm with a fixed blade easily locks into the motor body for effortless operation. The stainless steel fixed blade quickly blends ingredients for smoothies, milkshakes, soups, and baby food, and the quality of which attachment is a perfect addition to this blender.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MlG9Cp3DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 CORE","source_asin":"B09PJX1778","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PJX1778","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PJX1778","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
