window.products.push({"id":548797,"name":"NU2U 5\" shelf extention-compatible only with Gozney* Roccbox* Pizza Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZPxtfgN3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The R-5 shelf attachment is the newest addition to the NU2U* line up of specialty oven products. The R-5 is constructed of pure 304 Food Grade stainless steel and is 5\" deep creating the perfect mini shelf or ledge for resting your pizza peels and cast iron skillets and helping to get the perfect pizza launch! The patent pending NU2U* gusseted brace system ensures that this shelf stays in place while in use and can carry a lot weight. The NU2U* system installs in seconds without the need for any screws, nuts bolts or hardware. Other features of the R-5 is the integration of S-Hooks (Included-Zinc plated for anti corrosion) and S hook holes for hanging your oven mitts, pizza peel and other cooking utensils right at the oven door opening. The R-5 is also so versatile and compact it can be stored easily inside the oven when not in use or a common kitchen drawer. Making the perfect Neapolitan pizza just got easier! The R-5 provides 5\" inches of additional relief from the heat and additional turning space while also allowing a perfect rest for the pizza peel. Launching, turning and retrieving your pizza will be a breeze with the NU2U* R-5 oven attachment. Optional door for Wood 2.0 now available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZPxtfgN3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nu2u","source_asin":"B08Z4LSHM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z4LSHM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z4LSHM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548798,"name":"Panvola Mental Health Counselor Gifts Therapist Mug Novelty Inspirational Gift Idea Awareness Coffee Cup Black 11oz For Psychologist/Psychiatrist (11 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719C2HLGj0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KNOW YOUR PRIORITY: Taking care of your mental health is just as important as taking care of your physical health, and this mug is a reminder of that fact. Whether you're a mental health professional, someone who struggles with mental health issues, or simply an advocate for mental health awareness, this is a great way to show your support for this important cause. So take a moment to sip your coffee and remember that taking care of yourself, both physically and mentally, is always a priority PREMIUM CERAMIC COFFEE MUG: This high-quality 11oz ceramic mug has a premium hard coat that provides crisp and vibrant color reproduction sure to last for years. Printed on both sides for either left or right-handed person so the awesome message and art will be visible. High-gloss and has a premium finish that can make you enjoy your drink more. Can also be used as pen holders on your office work table, planter for your kitchen herb, jewelry holder, or serving your favorite dessert. A GIFT FOR YOURSELF TOO: Give a gift that creates a lasting impression. Your co worker, boss, colleague, manager, or office mate who is a programmer can now enjoy their favorite coffee drinks and other beverages with this funny and hilarious mug designed to send smiles and love. Trust us, you'll not only want to get this for your family or friends but also for yourself if you are metal health awareness advocate. PERFECT GIFT THAT STANDS OUT FROM THE REST: This is a gift for anyone who values the importance of mental health and wants to spread awareness about it. It could be a meaningful gift for someone who may be going through a difficult time, or for someone who works in the mental health field, a counselor, or therapist. It could also be a thoughtful gift for a friend or loved one who may be struggling with mental health issues and could use some support and encouragement. DISHWASHER AND MICROWAVE SAFE: These fantastic drinking mugs can go straight in the dishwasher, all day every day, meaning it can save you time, and be more hygienic. Perfect for your favorite hot or cold beverages. Easily reheat that coffee or tea you forgot to drink right away because it is microwave safe. Saves you time, is very convenient, and is perfect for your busy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719C2HLGj0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panvola","source_asin":"B0BXDLF4RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXDLF4RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXDLF4RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
