window.products.push({"id":548833,"name":"Couch Throw Blanket Linen Waffle - Sofa Throw Blanket for Couch with Linen Cotton, Farmhouse Throw Blanket Home Living Chair Luxury Women Gift Cozy & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pV9RVNgcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Normandy Material - Made of breathable linen and soft cotton, enhance a comfortable touch and natural texture. With exvellent durability, linen cotton will be softer over time. Size - 50*70 inch. It is the best choice for you to snuggle on the sofa, balcony, or bedroom & the best companion for traveling, reading, or camping. Double-layer Design - Merging Waffle Surface with Wrinkly Stone Washed Bottom, which gives you more flexibility in your room decor. A Great Gift - The linen blanket is suitable for boho, farmhouse, luxury, modern and other home styles. Outstanding material is your best gift for Mother's day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, anniversary, birthday. Care Guide - Machine wash up to 30°C / 86°F gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Iron up to 110°C / 230°F. Dry clean tetrachlorethylene. Do not tumble dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pV9RVNgcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATLINIA","source_asin":"B0BTYC5FPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYC5FPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYC5FPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":548834,"name":"Rosenthal Thomas Loft White Dinnerware Set – Modern Dishes including Dinner Plates, Salad Plates, Soup Plates and Mugs – Made of Porcelain – 16 pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":319.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D1ABkN4xL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Medusa Lumiere White Wine Glasses The wine glasses by Versace are perfectly in line with the timeless elegance and glamour that surrounds the Italian fashion house.The glasses are made of hand-blown crystal and feature a long stem that is ended with a gracefully shaped tulip bowl. Specialsigns of recognition are the three-dimensional Medusa head from the Greek mythology as well as the engraved brand logo at thebottom. The wine glasses come in an elegant gift box which also includes a certificate of authenticity. Rosenthal meets Versace The successful partnership between Rosenthal and Gianni Versace began in 1992 and ever since has represented the original visionof the Versace lifestyle as an all-embracing decision in combination with Rosenthal's zeitgeist. The sophisticated products that emergefrom this collaboration are more than functional glassware - they are unique pieces of art and design. Versace is an icon for extraordinarycraftsmanship and exquisite details. Rosenthal is widely known for a contemporary design approach and excellence in the field oftableware. Together, the two brands created a new universe and a way of life that speaks of timeless elegance and a refined style of living. Amazon.com Winner of a 2002 international design award, Loft dinnerware epitomizes an urban, modern lifestyle with its clean, all-white forms. The German-made porcelain is kept elegantly spare except for a subtle pattern of fine concentric circles that feels pleasing to the touch. While the Loft collection encompasses both round and square shapes for mix-and-match individuality, this particular 16-piece starter set contains just the round. Included are four place settings, each of which consists of the following: an 11-inch dinner plate, an 8-1/2-inch salad plate, a 9-1/2-inch coupe-style soup bowl, and a straight-sided mug. Rosenthal, long one of Germany's most prestigious porcelain manufacturers, produces dinnerware that graces the tables of outstanding hotels and restaurants worldwide. Loft was created by the Queensbury-Hunt Design Group for the Thomas brand that falls under Rosenthal's umbrella. Loft works equally well for an impromptu brunch or a celebratory dinner party and is safe for both the dishwasher and microwave. Handsomely boxed, the set is eminently suitable as a gift for the design-savvy friend or relative setting up a new kitchen or desiring a new tabletop look. A wide range of accessory pieces is available separately. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: dinner plate; salad plate; soup bowl; mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41D1ABkN4xL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosenthal","source_asin":"B000A5LR8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000A5LR8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000A5LR8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
