window.products.push({"id":548888,"name":"SKENDA Color Kitchen Knife Set - Colorful 6 Premium Steel Knives with Sheaths (13 pcs) - kitchen Knives Set Santoku, Chef, Bread, Carving, Paring, Uti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OKRBtlOhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You Need This Premium Color Knife Set To Get Dinner On The Table Quickly! Life is busy enough as it is, but that doesn't mean cooking has to be complicated by using the wrong knife for the dish you're preparing. This Kitchen Knife Set by Skenda includes every essential knife a gourmet knife set should have to chop, slice, carve, or cut any ingredient. This 13 Piece Kitchen Chef Knife Set Includes: 7\" Yellow Santoku Knife with Sheath8\" Grey Chef Knife with Sheath8\" Red Bread Knife with Sheath8\" Orange Carving Knife with Sheath5\" Lime Utility Knife with Sheath 3.5\" Turquoise Paring Knife with SheathDual Use Ceramic Peeler Don't Be A Blockhead Keeping clunky knife blocks on your counter is asking for trouble. Between pets, kids, or accidents, keeping sharp knives easily accessible in something as easy to tip over as a wooden block just doesn't make sense. Each cooking knife in this set comes with its own sheath so you can keep these kitchen knives with sleeves safely hidden in drawers or cupboards while the blades stay razor sharp, away from potential accidents. Keep your counter open and fingers safe thanks to this colored knife set with sheaths! Premium Quality Professional Knives Each culinary chef knife in this colorful knife set has a perfectly honed edge with a durable nonstick coating for machined precision performance that lasts. These BPA free knives will slip through like you are slicing into butter, no matter what food you are cutting! Nonporous, these premier knives are safe for your food and family! The ergonomic handle featured on this color knife set provide you with a higher degree of control allowing you to make precise, clean cuts. Get ready to give your meals the restaurant quality look after using this colorful culinary knife set! Add To Cart Now To Start Making The Cut In Your Own Kitchen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OKRBtlOhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKENDA","source_asin":"B0153NSPCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-548888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0153NSPCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0153NSPCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
